{"id":"rodilla","lemma":"rodilla","pos":"noun","rank":1651,"glosses":["knee (joint or region of the joint in the middle part of the leg between the thigh and the shank)"],"ipa":"/roˈdiʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rodillas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-rodilla.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ponte de rodillas.","en":"Get on your knees.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609247","words":[{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Él se golpeó en su rodilla.","en":"He banged his knee.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Ella sentía temblar sus rodillas.","en":"She felt her knees tremble.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},{"g":"to tremble"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Me está sangrando la rodilla.","en":"My knee is bleeding.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449854","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to bleed","l":"sangrar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ella podía sentir cómo temblaban sus rodillas.","en":"She could feel her knees shaking.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65206","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to feel"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"to tremble","l":"temblar"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]}]}